---
description: Project-wide AI agent instructions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow all instructions in @AGENTS.md in this repository root.

When working in a subdirectory, also read the local AGENTS.md if one exists (e.g., @backend/AGENTS.md, @frontend/AGENTS.md).

Key rules for in-editor work:
1. Self-contained code -- never import from outside this repository.
2. i18n keys for strings -- all user-facing text goes through `t("KEY")` in `i18n/keys.ts`; no hardcoded English in JSX.
3. cr-sdk is the only CR integration surface -- import from `@/lib/cr-sdk`, not from `@/lib/a2a-client` directly.
